{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "303bd5112ba384e2e4f61fef6846189a93677f1dcb5230b9efaca0ce410d472a", "ja": "でも、どうしてUFOがいたんだろう……。\nもしかして、劇場に遊びにきたとか？", "zh": "不过，为什么会有UFO呢……\n难道是来剧场玩的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ba8d4ef55df911aa5bf321a2b85159e0bc666efaad5d7d2ee15892f2907b5274", "ja": "そうだったら、いいな～。\nあっ、そう言えば、『月刊メー』の記事で……。", "zh": "要是那样就好了～。\n啊，对了，说起来，《月刊メー》的报道里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d5e9112993ab947b773538761ae470aaa43660b35fcc83e6c7a7fdac476fa5c1", "ja": "むむむ～っ……。\nと、届けー……届けぇ～っ！", "zh": "唔唔唔～……\n传、传过去……传过去呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "3a3dd797802f72a78e10e3a681b435b2ce372db89c548608d24463ca95d6eb04", "ja": "おはようございます～。おや～、どうしたんですか、\n雪歩さん？　なんだか、すごい迫力ですな～。", "zh": "早上好～。哎呀～，这是怎么了，\n雪步？感觉气势好惊人啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "73d1d241d9220980012b0aba3edb72903759217c14096634309371445f195140", "ja": "もしかして、アートをクリエイトするのに、\n悩んでるんですか？　聞かせてください！", "zh": "难道说，您是在为创作艺术\n而烦恼吗？快跟伴田说听听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4316bc7d45af27ecc264e2f027fcf75b7f26e9e4ee9011f695cdab5f015c901c", "ja": "あ、みんな！　ちょうどよかった。\nみんなも思いを届けるの、手伝ってくれない？", "zh": "啊，大家！来得正好。\n你们也愿意帮忙传达这份心意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "01a8c742efc390cb144633dca938b1a72f93598cd12c2cb2ae851a033ddde038", "ja": "はいっ！　雪歩ちゃんのためなら喜んでっ！", "zh": "没问题！为了雪步，我很乐意帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "aeda78d19dc59a96ddf530f5ce8d6c9d09cc18261fc5d7587fc0e8b1a3527c78", "ja": "で、何すればいいんだ？\n手紙とか、丸めてぶん投げる感じ？", "zh": "那么，我该做什么？\n比如把信揉成一团扔出去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "acfdf7237e1eb05e2dfb9b205820b380d5faae9056c44bf9afe439ff46510e8a", "ja": "たぶん、そういうことじゃない気がします！\nそれで、何をすればいいんでしょう？", "zh": "我觉得大概不是那回事！\n那么，我们该做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7b2c2ee0a31d75f0d79c9e129ed98452fd8154a6baf977a36f4fdee6e0e11cb4", "ja": "さて、雪歩はどこにいるんだろう。\n劇場には来てるはずなんだけど……。", "zh": "那么，雪步在哪里呢？\n她应该已经来剧场了才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1011_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "85042aa764c22e9e4537762c26c400cbf0842c99ea0e6c32ff723886bbc5fbed", "ja": "届け……届けぇ……宇宙人に届けぇ……！", "zh": "传达过去吧……传过去啊……传达给外星人吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "bfe8c1ee46307d0e6ee4cdd83c60984755a7b006ce1e53de2b0497e3466aeaf1", "ja": "ぐぬぬぬ～……！", "zh": "呜呜呜～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "5e5675c636e3726e1a7cab61a15b7698fc3d89cbf4c29e5aa6c541eafe335de7", "ja": "んんん～……！", "zh": "嗯嗯嗯～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "0b525b5c1ee400b9e18936a7c1768737fca5217270ffacdb090afae778a35ca2", "ja": "んぬぬぬっ……！", "zh": "嗯唔唔唔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "0d54da2a9602f54918f07edd0c5f309e0e2d4107695589de5175580e7db7a5a5", "ja": "むむむ～……。", "zh": "唔唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1017_p", "source_sha256": "252f5102d7edf66d891efb754e806f0db3c9da01294bfa83bc540ab4ab55e408", "ja": "（何だろう、この異様な光景は……？）", "zh": "（这究竟是怎样的诡异场面啊……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c1075e065357cbcd9c3a623f886a949eb3edb18e906c33635fc2238c1b695f74", "ja": "……ゴホン！　取り込み中のところ、すまない。\n雪歩に話があるんだけど。", "zh": "……咳咳！抱歉打扰你们一下。\n我有话想跟雪步说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fcee6e9efcef4ca3e054cf931fbfb52d74ecb074666a487bbf0dd15f14e8a98e", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nちょうどよかったです～。手を貸してください～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n来得正好～请搭把手吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1020_p", "source_sha256": "79fa8f30344d2186348e12cac96f7e9168b71c0258d32ce4a44b8628a1486e8f", "ja": "えっ？　まあ、手伝うのは構わないけど……\nみんなして、何やってるんだ？", "zh": "咦？帮忙倒是没问题，不过……\n你们都在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bc646084fa850d71726436f7a06a3398b3aa9e423316084e2ebfb5bb09ef4962", "ja": "宇宙人に、テレパシーを送ってるんです。\n「劇場に遊びに来て」って思いを込めて。全力で！", "zh": "在向外星人发送心灵感应呢。\n满怀着“来剧场玩吧”的心愿。全力以赴地！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1022_p", "source_sha256": "20c0e90c03310b730a2eb2802eec8bebd4ef8c2692fa451a50efe9eb3bc3bf6e", "ja": "宇宙人に、テレパシーを……。", "zh": "给外星人……发心灵感应吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2b77ab179910ff08f03c364321d2d1454079fcdadeb6192d47c796c90ade4daf", "ja": "はい。昨日、劇場の近くでUFOを見たんです。\nみんなで呼んだら、また来てくれるかなって。", "zh": "嗯。昨天我在剧场附近看到UFO了。\n我在想，要是大家一起呼唤，它会不会再来呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1024_p", "source_sha256": "70ec556c8758b0d4b71e7d7f5234ab0eb2e6689bde23f23186fc777ca2a1b5b2", "ja": "そうだったのか。手伝いたいところだが、その前に……\n大切な人にも、雪歩の思いを伝えてみないか？", "zh": "原来如此。我也想帮忙，不过在那之前……\n要不要先试着把雪步的心意传达给重要的人呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bad9f3ee2b87c3c5bad77d660e4ae2ee24cd0c29e6113776c65b6d90dff25346", "ja": "思いを？　……テレパシーで、ですか？", "zh": "心意吗？……是用心灵感应传达吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1026_p", "source_sha256": "b16d817483e7a640c8fa0acff6baaf8d28bf5fcc113228b19895c73d2cb18aff", "ja": "い、いや、手紙だと助かるかな。\n手紙を書いて朗読する、っていう仕事がきてるんだ。", "zh": "不、不，我想要是写信的话会比较方便。\n有一份工作，是写信后再朗读出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "506198437662fa55b847457c89b75a3c2e2b3433fee1e53a8f4411d3ee568e12", "ja": "わぁ……素敵ですね♪　いつもメールとかメッセージで\n済ませちゃうから、なんだか新鮮かもですぅ。", "zh": "哇……真好呢♪　平时都是发邮件或者发消息\n应付过去，总觉得挺新鲜的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1028_025roc", "source_sha256": "b21583d96143c2e6f24d9d3f02c4c63d3facad8570639eb4358876487912299b", "ja": "ユキホは、ポエムのスペシャリストですからね！\nどんなレターになるか、楽しみです♪", "zh": "雪步可是诗歌专家呢！\n真期待会写出怎样的信♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1029_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ef112215cc734e82755fe97946946d116d8b00369776626f70d7a886a05f318c", "ja": "スペシャリストだなんて……\nほ、褒めすぎだよ、ロコちゃん。えへへへへっ♪", "zh": "居然说什么专家……\n你、你夸得太过头了，ROCO。嘿嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1030_042miy", "source_sha256": "e3301d87478866a4e681087e9a53d8a85c848da4ba8389876d24f59f152366e1", "ja": "雪歩さんが、お手紙を書いて朗読ですか～。\nとっても心地良い時間が過ごせそうですね～。", "zh": "雪步小姐写信并朗读吗～。听起来能度过一段非常惬意的时光呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "75fa0f5e3be8f7a5f54b104aee5ebd55a82ac3226551a36060386b69cc3d17f8", "ja": "自分の手紙をみんなの前で読む、ってことか～。\nあははっ、オレならハズくてできないかも！", "zh": "也就是说，要在大家面前读自己的信啊——。\n哈哈，要是我的话，可能会害羞得做不到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1032_004yuk", "source_sha256": "38e30ef2dd20e446d95744548c585f84d61f259caea2fb20ac223259b733a18d", "ja": "あっ。言われてみると、たしかに……。ひぃぃぃぃ！\nよく考えたら、公開処刑も同然ですぅ～～！！", "zh": "啊。被你这么一说，确实……噫噫噫噫！\n仔细想想，这跟公开处刑根本没两样嘛～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1033_p", "source_sha256": "bab881fce53a59873d859d61d0348fafa821efde3b9755db654a73a45842b1be", "ja": "い、いや、朗読は事前収録になるから！　その音声に\n映像をつけて、レタームービーの形にするそうだ。", "zh": "不、不是，朗读是事先录音的！说是会给声音\n配上画面，做成信件影片的形式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bb4dd1d96a22328549fcbd8fb0ab1ead96cc4afd2e5bbf557485f563914bd5b0", "ja": "レタームービー……。収録ですか？\nじゃ、じゃあ、大丈夫なのかも……？", "zh": "书信短片……是要录音吗？\n那、那样的话，说不定没问题……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1035_p", "source_sha256": "7c4fc663e168bfd0a1e68717c5af65c90b74cf9c09d6e6922702abb222ad629b", "ja": "今回は番組のパイロット版\n……いわゆるテスト版になるらしい。", "zh": "这次似乎是节目的试播版……\n……也就是所谓的测试版。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3ecfe3e8eed627c3d67e09c6891d84e8af39035deb404a6fc702e9dc9c7925aa", "ja": "ただ、せっかくだから、\n劇場でも流させてもらえることになっている。", "zh": "不过，难得有这个机会，也决定让它在剧场播放。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1037_047sub", "source_sha256": "33234324ea6b05d3abfcff9e1144ef7a3a0d925beca65c16a101cc5b8f57fc59", "ja": "手紙かー。ファンレターを読んでると、\n元気出るよな。みんな、すっげーほめてくれてさ！", "zh": "信件啊——读着粉丝来信，整个人都会打起精神来呢。大家都特别夸我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "f665ee96205bd7168e96e800e0cb04e233d4468e7d451b6f4a34b0bbd17a4fa4", "ja": "ファンレターは、推しに自分の思いを届ける\n由緒正しい手段ですから。書く方も気合いが違います！", "zh": "粉丝来信可是向自己喜欢的偶像传达心意的正统方式。写信的人也会格外用心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1039_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5f18ef531035b2ea4974dc527d094a2ba049983d370e9c53934aa8ad95f51100", "ja": "うん……。言葉に自分の思いを込めて、届ける……。\nポエムと一緒かも。", "zh": "嗯……把自己的心意融入话语中，传达出去……\n或许和写诗差不多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1040_p", "source_sha256": "8125f5f68cd9f84f0522bcf47f5f42a0197fb105d23b4e9c0e734c6b6ddc383a", "ja": "それで、この仕事を引き受けるか、\n相談しにきたんだけど……。", "zh": "所以，我是来商量要不要接下这份工作的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1041_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5a0c5f319c183813618901c0710b309a5036aa9f51daa50839ca2c0f5348d64a", "ja": "わ、私、やります。やってみたいです！", "zh": "我、我想接！我想试一试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1042_p", "source_sha256": "3f5376cc1a931be87db3f9a2eadc1a8e48ed5a644b879aeec040557d732b7b72", "ja": "よし！　それじゃあ、先方には返事をしておくよ。\n企画書と資料のデータを送るから、確認しといてくれ。", "zh": "好！那我这就去回复对方。\n企划书和资料的数据我发给你，记得确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1043_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8c3dceaa3576f68d66b8908f8925ec47ccd6606129aa79cfeaf794aeb74187c4", "ja": "わかりました～。\n……お手紙って久しぶりだけど、大丈夫だよね。", "zh": "明白了～。\n……写信还是头一回，不过应该没问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1044_null", "source_sha256": "7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435", "ja": "その日の夜……", "zh": "当天晚上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1045_004yuk", "source_sha256": "73cea121317aaf827f1492b165dad5ec7ef16fc8fc2662a893e5c1a434712d31", "ja": "便箋もペンも封筒も用意したし、早速始めようっと！\n『大切な人』へのお手紙か。う～ん……。", "zh": "信纸、笔和信封都准备好了，马上开始吧！\n给“重要的人”写信啊。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1046_null", "source_sha256": "7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2", "ja": "1時間後……", "zh": "一个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1047_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4b0027649f7b44c2bcd215e3502168f6b0dc65a451da489b8e33e66dba2501d6", "ja": "あうぅ……。一文字も浮かばないよ～……。\n『大切な人』って、いっぱいいて、誰に書いたら……。", "zh": "呜呜……一个字都想不出来～……\n“重要的人”有好多，到底该写给谁才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1048_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a46ac2f7cc7be6dd4c202873d224c22b7176e89382e2f8de3095299ea14f66f9", "ja": "あっ……でも、そっか……。\nせっかく、こういう機会だから……。", "zh": "啊……不过，说得也是……。\n难得有这样的机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_149_1049_p", "source_sha256": "6f1e7646ef6f559a33698c8d67af14993580f561d9a369e2caeba6451cb417f8", "ja": "（そして、雪歩の朗読の収録が始まった……）", "zh": "（然后，雪步的朗读录音开始了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
